{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/185800e632991e40248ee6c9d2ddba35.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Burn is our love letter to the early \u201990s cute-em-up classics like\u00a0Parodius\u00a0and\u00a0Pop\u2019n TwinBee\u00a0\u2014 games that were bold, wildly creative, and completely, delightfully bonkers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.webp?t=1773619273\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.webp?t=1773619273\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.webp?t=1773619273\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is a cute-em-up?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute-\u2019em-up is a playful twist on the classic shoot-\u2019em-up genre, blending fast-paced arcade action with adorably chaotic characters and worlds. Expect all the dodging, blasting, and bullet-hell intensity you love\u2014wrapped in bright, charming, and often hilarious visuals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Build up your catnip power bar and trigger your\u00a0MEODOOOKEN!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building up power bar to unlease special weapons is pretty much in most bullet hell games, but what makes this unique is that the power moves are like Anime bonkers fighting action moves! watch our space cat turn into a hulk and unleash feline fury!!!\u00a0 \u00a0There are tons of these special moves, and are random, so if you get that special legendary move - its special!\u00a0 (think Pokemon!!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/dad69be4f7c5ce2a36ed906b4f2fd6eb.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/dad69be4f7c5ce2a36ed906b4f2fd6eb.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/dad69be4f7c5ce2a36ed906b4f2fd6eb.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/1cf8987b1a3b0f70a11e5e11bd5fcb28.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astro Burn</i>\u00a0isn\u2019t just a mindless bullet-hell cute-\u2019em-up \u2014 there\u2019s real heart at its core. Between each level, a story unfolds as we follow Astro on her own \u201cfollow the yellow brick road\u201d journey to find her way back home with her robot sidekick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if the chaos we\u2019re battling through isn\u2019t just external? What if every level is a manifestation of Astro\u2019s feline subconscious \u2014 a dream\u2026 or perhaps a nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b7a5b0b85577e928e9728f23f0daf1a5.avif?t=1773619273\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with outrageous weapon combos, a rocket-fuelled jetpack, and purrfectly tuned reflexes, you\u2019ll blast through\u00a0absurd bullet-hell swarms, dodge rainbow-coloured laser storms, and face off against\u00a0giant cosmic creatures\u00a0who rule the galaxy with an aggressively adorable iron paw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect\u00a0screen-filling mecha pandas,\u00a0hyperactive huskies wagging up solar vortexes,\u00a0opera-singing space squids, and\u00a0celestial goldfish launching star-shaped projectiles\u00a0\u2014 all delivered with the wonderfully unhinged, anything-goes spirit of the 90s arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/22b58f0d8d99dfd9c7256cc4ed018fb9.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/22b58f0d8d99dfd9c7256cc4ed018fb9.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/22b58f0d8d99dfd9c7256cc4ed018fb9.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is\u00a0cute-em-up chaos\u00a0dialled to MAX \u2014 a nostalgic side-scrolling shooter inspired by 16-bit arcade madness, reborn with modern pixel art, tight controls, and over-the-top personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s retro mayhem with a cosmic wink: giant animal bosses, unhinged bullet patterns, cosmic comedy, and jetpack-fuelled heroics all wrapped into one delightfully chaotic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nostalgic side-scrolling <strong>Cute -\u2019em-up</strong> inspired by 16-bit classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn with slick modern pixel art, tight controls, and <strong>adrenaline-pumping action</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 lives cat health system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Co-Op Arcade modes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each level as you progress, with the freedom to replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn steam achievements\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging end of level bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack-em up weapon system:\u00a0 Collect as many weapons and fire them all at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 10 diverse levels\u2014from deep space and mechanical worlds to Earth\u2019s skies, underwater realms, sprawling cities, and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 3\u20135 hours of action-packed gameplay, with even more hours to sink in through skill mastery and level replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Score leaderboard with Time (hello speed-runs!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your Catnip power bar to unleash Feline Fury Special moves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome synth-wave retro cool soundtrack by Venice Bleach, with a dash of meow-ness layered in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did we also say - Surreal Bonkers end of level bosses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/69742b7767218a6b8e64774ee2555648.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/69742b7767218a6b8e64774ee2555648.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/69742b7767218a6b8e64774ee2555648.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/a8724721928b9b16b986e424fd158364.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the chaos \u2014 team up in co-op mode! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share weapons and work together to take down the evil machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive co-op, Space cat with the highest score is the winner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f8d5a2421736a734eee92ab757cdf085.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f8d5a2421736a734eee92ab757cdf085.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f8d5a2421736a734eee92ab757cdf085.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b159675897bda83c64ae58e6319d4397.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way to the top of the leaderboard in this purr-fectly retro space shooter \u2014 will you be the ultimate space cat with the high score to match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Leaderboard (with classic 3 letter initials with your score and fastest time)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboard via Discord, to share with your friends, community of Astro Burner's and join discord tournaments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/a3a551825c0b9752442e83a531f4bde2.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the options menu,\u00a0 select &quot;connect to discord&quot;,\u00a0 and now whenever you play the game and hit that highscore with an impressive speed run, all your discord friends will see it - now thats a flex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/79d67df4c90734373a987b7fb09c69af.avif?t=1773619273\" width=476 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810660?t=1773619273","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/d92932c84f1fc8b5172b19f859bb56dec4e7402d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773619273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/32f1ab8754221af4af4366af205b64f705d6ead7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773619273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/32f1ab8754221af4af4366af205b64f705d6ead7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773619273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4048530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/185800e632991e40248ee6c9d2ddba35.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Burn is our love letter to the early \u201990s cute-em-up classics like\u00a0Parodius\u00a0and\u00a0Pop\u2019n TwinBee\u00a0\u2014 games that were bold, wildly creative, and completely, delightfully bonkers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.webp?t=1773619273\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.webp?t=1773619273\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.webp?t=1773619273\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is a cute-em-up?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute-\u2019em-up is a playful twist on the classic shoot-\u2019em-up genre, blending fast-paced arcade action with adorably chaotic characters and worlds. Expect all the dodging, blasting, and bullet-hell intensity you love\u2014wrapped in bright, charming, and often hilarious visuals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Build up your catnip power bar and trigger your\u00a0MEODOOOKEN!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building up power bar to unlease special weapons is pretty much in most bullet hell games, but what makes this unique is that the power moves are like Anime bonkers fighting action moves! watch our space cat turn into a hulk and unleash feline fury!!!\u00a0 \u00a0There are tons of these special moves, and are random, so if you get that special legendary move - its special!\u00a0 (think Pokemon!!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/dad69be4f7c5ce2a36ed906b4f2fd6eb.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/dad69be4f7c5ce2a36ed906b4f2fd6eb.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/dad69be4f7c5ce2a36ed906b4f2fd6eb.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/1cf8987b1a3b0f70a11e5e11bd5fcb28.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astro Burn</i>\u00a0isn\u2019t just a mindless bullet-hell cute-\u2019em-up \u2014 there\u2019s real heart at its core. Between each level, a story unfolds as we follow Astro on her own \u201cfollow the yellow brick road\u201d journey to find her way back home with her robot sidekick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if the chaos we\u2019re battling through isn\u2019t just external? What if every level is a manifestation of Astro\u2019s feline subconscious \u2014 a dream\u2026 or perhaps a nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b7a5b0b85577e928e9728f23f0daf1a5.avif?t=1773619273\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with outrageous weapon combos, a rocket-fuelled jetpack, and purrfectly tuned reflexes, you\u2019ll blast through\u00a0absurd bullet-hell swarms, dodge rainbow-coloured laser storms, and face off against\u00a0giant cosmic creatures\u00a0who rule the galaxy with an aggressively adorable iron paw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect\u00a0screen-filling mecha pandas,\u00a0hyperactive huskies wagging up solar vortexes,\u00a0opera-singing space squids, and\u00a0celestial goldfish launching star-shaped projectiles\u00a0\u2014 all delivered with the wonderfully unhinged, anything-goes spirit of the 90s arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/22b58f0d8d99dfd9c7256cc4ed018fb9.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/22b58f0d8d99dfd9c7256cc4ed018fb9.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/22b58f0d8d99dfd9c7256cc4ed018fb9.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is\u00a0cute-em-up chaos\u00a0dialled to MAX \u2014 a nostalgic side-scrolling shooter inspired by 16-bit arcade madness, reborn with modern pixel art, tight controls, and over-the-top personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s retro mayhem with a cosmic wink: giant animal bosses, unhinged bullet patterns, cosmic comedy, and jetpack-fuelled heroics all wrapped into one delightfully chaotic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nostalgic side-scrolling <strong>Cute -\u2019em-up</strong> inspired by 16-bit classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn with slick modern pixel art, tight controls, and <strong>adrenaline-pumping action</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 lives cat health system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Co-Op Arcade modes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each level as you progress, with the freedom to replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn steam achievements\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging end of level bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack-em up weapon system:\u00a0 Collect as many weapons and fire them all at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 10 diverse levels\u2014from deep space and mechanical worlds to Earth\u2019s skies, underwater realms, sprawling cities, and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 3\u20135 hours of action-packed gameplay, with even more hours to sink in through skill mastery and level replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Score leaderboard with Time (hello speed-runs!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your Catnip power bar to unleash Feline Fury Special moves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome synth-wave retro cool soundtrack by Venice Bleach, with a dash of meow-ness layered in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did we also say - Surreal Bonkers end of level bosses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/69742b7767218a6b8e64774ee2555648.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/69742b7767218a6b8e64774ee2555648.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/69742b7767218a6b8e64774ee2555648.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/a8724721928b9b16b986e424fd158364.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the chaos \u2014 team up in co-op mode! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share weapons and work together to take down the evil machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive co-op, Space cat with the highest score is the winner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f8d5a2421736a734eee92ab757cdf085.poster.avif?t=1773619273\" width=722 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f8d5a2421736a734eee92ab757cdf085.webm?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f8d5a2421736a734eee92ab757cdf085.mp4?t=1773619273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b159675897bda83c64ae58e6319d4397.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way to the top of the leaderboard in this purr-fectly retro space shooter \u2014 will you be the ultimate space cat with the high score to match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Leaderboard (with classic 3 letter initials with your score and fastest time)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboard via Discord, to share with your friends, community of Astro Burner's and join discord tournaments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/a3a551825c0b9752442e83a531f4bde2.avif?t=1773619273\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the options menu,\u00a0 select &quot;connect to discord&quot;,\u00a0 and now whenever you play the game and hit that highscore with an impressive speed run, all your discord friends will see it - now thats a flex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/79d67df4c90734373a987b7fb09c69af.avif?t=1773619273\" width=476 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Beyond The PIxels"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/b02be8ba22b25765fd8c50bc0329d18284a290f7/header.jpg?t=1773619273","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Astro Burn is an original IP created and owned by Beyond The Pixels \u00ae Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810660/1098855956/054eb5002d6467a079207f935bc9d47eac0c59e6/1770737365/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770737909","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810660/1098855956/054eb5002d6467a079207f935bc9d47eac0c59e6/1770737365/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770737909","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810660/1098855956/054eb5002d6467a07